> Contracts and verification

Every unsigned64 integer is supported, including UINT64_MAX. The emitted
vector<bool> has no specified byte serialization or endianness framing. The
caller supplies the requested value count. Single-value append prepares the
complete word and admits destination geometry before insertion, preserving the
old prefix and avoiding partial append on failure. Encoding and parsing share
producing kernels with their trace variants. Actual trace records count full
owned input/output stream bits, original/decoded values, word records and block
records; field scalars, capacities/output/runtime copies and bytes/RAM are
excluded. Default cap is one million actual logical records, checked before
append;0 disables only that optional cap. Complete trace or exception, never an
incomplete result.

Independent Python integer/bitstring construction verified2135 values, emitted
words, decoded values and actual consumed/prefix/payload bit counts across power
boundaries, random full64-bit values and UINT64_MAX. Another10000 random
full64-bit emitted words and valid parsed streams matched the frozen
implementation exactly. Native tests retain the original10001-value range,
actual emitted/read spans,256-codeword prefix freedom, all representative
truncations, malformed depth/counts, unread tails, complete
quotas/append/empty/ownership controls. The complete ten-report batch passed77
native CTest cases,39 directly instrumented ASan/UBSan cases,106
compiled/executed public examples,479/479 scoped definitions and ten
representative clangd hovers. All4 complete report programs executed and all4
native figures were visually reviewed. HTML/Markdown computed result and
identical source/build/export figure bytes passed verification. Repeatable
receipts are retained under `build/mepml-conversion/batch-194-203/`.

> References

V. I. Levenshtein(1968),
[On the Redundancy and Delay of Decodable Coding of Natural Numbers|https://www.compression.ru/download/articles/int/levenstein_1968_on_the_redundancy_and_delay.pdf],
Problems of Cybernetics20,173–179, original Russian text. The precise
zero-inclusive recursive stream convention implemented here is stated above; its
finite unsigned64 validation and prefix framing are native API contracts.
